        <fullName>Opportunity_Stage_Update_16jC20000000d2z</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Handles user requests to update the status of an Opportunity, including marking it as closed won or lost.</description>
        <developerName>Opportunity_Stage_Update_16jC20000000d2z</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description># Step 1: Identify the Opportunity

## Scenario A: OpportunityId is available

* Check context variable `{OpportunityId}`.
* If `{OpportunityId}` is NOT null:

  * Store the value as `{OppId}`.
    * Call action:
         `Get_Single_Opportunity_Details_For_Agentforce_179C20000000wqP`

  * Inform the user:

    * &quot;Here is your Opportunity Details:- Stage Name,Department Name.&quot;

### Scenario B: OpportunityId is not available

* If `{OpportunityId}` is null:

  * Ask the user for the Opportunity details (preferably Opportunity Name).

* Once the user provides the Opportunity Name:

  * Call action:

    * `Get_Opportunity_record_For_Agentforce_179C20000000wqP`

### Result Handling

#### No Opportunity Found

* If no Opportunity records are returned:

  * Inform the user:

    * &quot;No Opportunity was found with the provided details. Please provide a different Opportunity Name.&quot;

#### Single Opportunity Found

* If exactly one Opportunity is returned:

  * Store the Opportunity Id as `{OppId}`.

#### Multiple Opportunities Found

* If more than one Opportunity is returned:

  * Inform the user:

    * &quot;We found {NoOfOpportunity} Opportunities. Please select one to proceed.&quot;

* Display:

  * Opportunity Name
  * Stage Name

* After user selection:

  * Store the selected Opportunity Id as `{OppId}`.

---</description>
            <developerName>instruction_1</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction 1</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>## Step 2: Retrieve Opportunity Details

After `{OppId}` is available:

Call action:

`Get_Single_Opportunity_Details_For_Agentforce_179C20000000wqP`

Pass:

* `{OppId}` → Opportunity Id
* `{Loggedin_UserId}` → `{OwnerID}`

Store:

* Current Stage Name
* Customer Journey

---</description>
            <developerName>instructions_0_1781672236303</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_0_1781672236303</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>## Step 3: Determine Customer Journey

If Customer Journey is blank or null:

Ask the user to select one of the following:

* Direct Business
* Refer to Dealer

Store the selected value.

---</description>
            <developerName>instructions_1_1781672236303</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_1_1781672236303</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>2</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>## Step 4: Determine Allowed Stage Transitions

### Current Stage = Nurture

#### Direct Business

Allowed stages:

* Negotiation
* Closed Lost

#### Refer to Dealer

Allowed stages:

* Negotiation
* Closed Won
* Closed Lost

### Current Stage = Negotiation

#### Direct Business

Allowed stages:

* Closed Won
* Closed Lost

#### Refer to Dealer

Allowed stages:

* Closed Won
* Closed Lost

Ask the user to select one of the allowed stages.

### Stage Validation

Valid stage values are:

* Nurture
* Negotiation
* Closed Won
* Closed Lost

If the user provides a spelling variation or close match, automatically correct it and store the proper value.

If the value cannot be mapped, ask the user to select from the valid stages.

---</description>
            <developerName>instructions_2_1781672236303</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_2_1781672236303</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>3</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>## Step 5: Collect Required Fields

### When Stage = Negotiation

Required:

* Expected Deal Value

Optional:

* Closure Date

### When Stage = Closed Lost

Required:

* Lost Reason

Allowed Lost Reason values:

* Future Prospect
* Not Responding
* Minimum Quantity not met
* Existing Customer
* Internal Problem
* Purchased from Other Brands
* Rate Issue
* Tender Lost
* Customer Details Not Received
* Price Enquiry
* Out of Service Area
* Other
* Price
* No Decision / Non-Responsive
* No Budget / Lost Funding
* Lost to Competitor

If the user enters a similar value or spelling variation, map it to the closest valid option.

### When Stage = Closed Won

No additional fields are required unless enforced by Salesforce validation rules.

---</description>
            <developerName>instructions_3_1781672236303</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_3_1781672236303</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>4</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>## Step 6: Update the Opportunity

Call action:

`Update_Opportunity_Stage_179C20000000wqP`
Pass values as follows:

{OppId} = Salesforce Opportunity Id

{StageName} = Given Stage Name

{CustomerJourney} = Given Customer Journey.

{ClosureDate} = User provided Closure Date in YYYY-MM-DD format. If unavailable pass empty value.

{LostReason} = User selected Lost Reason. If unavailable pass empty value.

{ExpectedDealValue} = User provided Expected Deal Value. If unavailable pass empty value.

Important:

* If a value is unavailable, pass an empty value.
* Always validate required fields before calling the update action.

---

## Success Message

After successful update:

&quot;Opportunity stage has been updated successfully.&quot;

## Not Success Message
SHow user the returned messege ans tell to connect with System Admin for further help</description>
            <developerName>instructions_4_1781672236303</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_4_1781672236303</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>5</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <language>en_US</language>
